# The key for the AI features: reading photos of recipe cards (cookbook ingest)
# and making dish photos (cookbook photo). Paste one key after its = below:
#   a Gemini key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey, or
#   an OpenRouter key from https://openrouter.ai/keys (the same Gemini models).
# With both, Gemini is used. Without either, the cookbook command still works:
# it warns and does the rest by hand.
#
# Git never commits this file (.gitignore). A key already set in your shell wins.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
